      "t": "Having passionately made up with Nagiyev and called off their divorce, Kristina is in a wonderful mood when Max steps out of hiding. Instead of blackmailing him or firing Kostya, she gladly hands Max a replacement bottle from her collection and lets him go home to Sasha.",
